p&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c292f0c561f577f4459fe9910aafc84", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13a6608c/uploads/origins/5685b8e5-e32f-475b-bb0e-959b77f6dcf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c292f0c561f577f4459fe9910aafc84, https://si.imgix.net/13a6608c/uploads/origins/5685b8e5-e32f-475b-bb0e-959b77f6dcf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60a4946295a498a1620f7f40db63126f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13a6608c/uploads/origins/5685b8e5-e32f-475b-bb0e-959b77f6dcf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=468ea96494f8def767482fe95880afa8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I would like to request  an artwork for this character \n\n https://toyhou.se/10350380.loki   \nPersonality: Cool, prideful, arrogant, dominating (queen type)   He doesn’t smile much. He is a boy with pretty face.\n\nI’ll leave the pose and details up to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bikku__2/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7aa959e/uploads/origins/e2aae8b4-6cf5-427d-8520-d968eaa735d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf3b69ecd74540db786af8733edab592", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7aa959e/uploads/origins/e2aae8b4-6cf5-427d-8520-d968eaa735d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf3b69ecd74540db786af8733edab592, https://si.imgix.net/d7aa959e/uploads/origins/e2aae8b4-6cf5-427d-8520-d968eaa735d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34308bd7aef48db55e7b58d04a170758 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7aa959e/uploads/origins/e2aae8b4-6cf5-427d-8520-d968eaa735d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=643d9b05f779b89f42f7253590109301 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!!!\nI like your style very much. Sorry for your busy schedule, but if you don't mind, I would like to ask you to illustrate an original character for me.\n\nPlease refer to the following for the appearance and other materials.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10DDV_Ld-yBwNzhKbzR9Tzy7E_U9W3OId?usp=sharing\nI will leave everything to you, including the costume and composition. I would be happy if you could draw freely.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bikku__2/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/00125476/uploads/origins/9d39ea37-ea70-4afc-bda3-58e6d1215ef1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=169ae72bd1a5400d5da90a28cd923ad2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/00125476/uploads/origins/9d39ea37-ea70-4afc-bda3-58e6d1215ef1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=169ae72bd1a5400d5da90a28cd923ad2, https://si.imgix.net/00125476/uploads/origins/9d39ea37-ea70-4afc-bda3-58e6d1215ef1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f5a672a45fdd3c11b9c23ba7af2bedb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00125476/uploads/origins/9d39ea37-ea70-4afc-bda3-58e6d1215ef1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26a1b072cedd9bac7ff3b5f7817fd431 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear bikku, nice to meet you!\nI'm sorry for the sudden intrusion.\nI like your pictures very much and I always enjoy looking at your wonderful works.\nMy Japanese is not very good, if there is any difference, please understand me a lot.\n\nI would like to ask you to create an illustration of our couple for my personal viewing if you don't mind.\nYou can choose any of the outfits from the reference url.\nI will leave the composition, pose, etc. up to you. (I will leave the composition, poses, etc. up to you.\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kSUY1hXQptwPCJYYndv_7DdLk9tdag5v?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bikku__2/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e38c77f/uploads/origins/81f6ff35-9912-4d0d-96ff-f56f8cf94367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c5fb9e29d1d3eab8127f268d4439b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6e38c77f/uploads/origins/81f6ff35-9912-4d0d-96ff-f56f8cf94367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c5fb9e29d1d3eab8127f268d4439b8, https://si.imgix.net/6e38c77f/uploads/origins/81f6ff35-9912-4d0d-96ff-f56f8cf94367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51b3b2b82ebfd3f9c00cd78ccbb10290 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6e38c77f/uploads/origins/81f6ff35-9912-4d0d-96ff-f56f8cf94367?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6c3be339d9d207e1202d33913f3aec1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I’d like to request an artwork of this boy: https://toyhou.se/11581813.shiro \n\nPersonality: mischievous, sly, playful   \n\nI’ll leave the pose and details up to you.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@bikku__2/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e96ab10/uploads/origins/e988c3fd-157d-42bb-ac06-6a9431ace1af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dc6a26df17a18efbe894c28cf119839", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e96ab10/uploads/origins/e988c3fd-157d-42bb-ac06-6a9431ace1af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2dc6a26df17a18efbe894c28cf119839, https://si.imgix.net/2e96ab10/uploads/origins/e988c3fd-157d-42bb-ac06-6a9431ace1af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f98c9c32cc55599cd20fe3e3c6bde70 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e96ab10/uploads/origins/e988c3fd-157d-42bb-ac06-6a9431ace1af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4359ae791c4f4d77493697ccf97a69b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": fals